        <zone flipboard-zone-id='5' forceUpdate='true' h='32988' hidden='true' id='10' story-point-id='7' type-v2='text' w='33268' x='83071' y='25726'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#002060' fontname='Cambria,serif' fontsize='18' underline='true'>Growth Rate Comparison: </run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Cambria,serif' fontsize='12'>This sheet explores the relationship between Average Growth Rate and difference in House prices across the years 2015 &amp; 2025 using a Double Axis Line &amp; Bar Graph. </run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Cambria,serif' fontsize='12'>The visualization reveals that despite varying Growth Rates the Difference in Prices of Housing generally depends on the Increase in Inflation in that Particular Country.</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='12'>Æ </run>
          </formatted-text>
        </zone>
        <zone flipboard-zone-id='5' forceUpdate='true' h='35685' hidden='true' id='11' story-point-id='2' type-v2='text' w='33268' x='83563' y='27490'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#002060' fontname='Cambria,serif' fontsize='18' underline='true'>House Type Preference: </run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Times New Roman,serif' fontsize='12'>This sheet compares what people with different incomes prefer as their House Type with the help of Multiple Pie Charts.</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='12'>Æ </run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Times New Roman,serif' fontsize='12'>This visual shows that people with High incomes prefer Expensive to Medium Range Accommodations while Low-income ones Prefer Cheaper Housing as Expected.</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='12'>Æ </run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Times New Roman,serif' fontsize='12'>But the anomaly comes with Middle class people where Majority of them either have the Most expensive or the Cheapest Accommodation.</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='12'>Æ </run>
          </formatted-text>
        </zone>
        <zone flipboard-zone-id='5' forceUpdate='true' h='29564' hidden='true' id='12' story-point-id='3' type-v2='text' w='33268' x='83366' y='24481'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#002060' fontname='Cambria,serif' fontsize='18' underline='true'>Inaffordability Ratio to PPP Index: </run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Times New Roman,serif' fontsize='12'>This sheet examines the relationship between Average PPP Index, Average Population Growth &amp; their effects on Inaffordability Ratio by Country with the help of Map Visual.</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='12'>Æ </run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Times New Roman,serif' fontsize='12'>The visualization suggests that Higher Population Growth overtime results in High PPP Index which in turn results in Higher Inaffordability in Housing Prices.</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='12'>Æ </run>
          </formatted-text>
        </zone>
        <zone flipboard-zone-id='5' forceUpdate='true' h='34751' hidden='true' id='13' story-point-id='4' type-v2='text' w='33268' x='97933' y='17531'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#002060' fontname='Cambria,serif' fontsize='18' underline='true'>Inflation &amp; Interest Rates: </run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Times New Roman,serif' fontsize='12'>This sheet organizes Average Inflation Rate &amp; Interest Rates of Countries in the form of a Tree Map on the basis of Inflation Rates. The bigger the area, the bigger the Inflation Rate of the Country.</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='12'>Æ </run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Times New Roman,serif' fontsize='12'>This distribution helps to understand that while Inflation Rate plays little Role in Interest Rates the difference in both rates is more in countries with Low Inflation as compared to Countries with High inflation.</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='12'>Æ </run>
          </formatted-text>
        </zone>
        <zone flipboard-zone-id='5' forceUpdate='true' h='43983' hidden='true' id='14' story-point-id='5' type-v2='text' w='33268' x='93307' y='17427'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#002060' fontname='Cambria,serif' fontsize='18' underline='true'>Price to PPP Index &amp; Market Status: </run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Times New Roman,serif' fontsize='12'>This sheet combines factors like PPP Index &amp; Market status situations of Countries in Comparative Scatter Plot. The visualization helps quickly identify patterns and outliers in the data. It is useful for spotting regions with balanced growth versus those facing economic pressure.</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='12'>Æ </run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Times New Roman,serif' fontsize='12'>We can arrive at a conclusion by this visual that a Declining Economy shows Average to Mid-Range Housing prices while if the Market of a Country is Booming the Housing Prices doesn&apos;t become Cheap in turn they lie majorly in Mid-Range to High Range.</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='12'>Æ </run>
          </formatted-text>
        </zone>
        <zone flipboard-zone-id='5' forceUpdate='true' h='56639' hidden='true' id='15' story-point-id='6' type-v2='text' w='43799' x='98917' y='17635'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#002060' fontname='Cambria,serif' fontsize='18' underline='true'>Dashboard 1 - Global Housing Overview:</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='18'>Æ </run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Cambria,serif' fontsize='12'>Dashboard of How growth Rate, Inaffordability Ratio &amp; PPP Index influence Housing Affordability.</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='12'>Æ </run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Cambria,serif' fontsize='12'>It includes visuals showing comparison of Difference in price from 2015 to 2025 &amp; Growth Rate % of Countries.</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='12'>Æ </run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Cambria,serif' fontsize='12'>This dashboard provides a high-level view of housing prices, growth rates, and affordability across countries. It helps users quickly compare overall market performance and identify global trends. It highlights which regions are experiencing rapid growth and where housing is becoming expensive.</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='12'>Æ </run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Cambria,serif' fontsize='12' underline='true'>KPIs Used:</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='12'>Æ </run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Cambria,serif' fontsize='12'>Average Growth Rate across Countries.</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='12'>Æ </run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Cambria,serif' fontsize='12'>Average Difference in Price from 2015 to 2025.</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='12'>Æ </run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Cambria,serif' fontsize='12'>Average Purchasing Power Parity Index.</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='12'>Æ </run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Cambria,serif' fontsize='12'>Average Population growth across Countries.</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='12'>Æ </run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Cambria,serif' fontsize='12'>Average Inaffordability Ratio increase from 2015 &amp; 2025. </run>
          </formatted-text>
        </zone>
        <zone flipboard-zone-id='5' forceUpdate='true' h='46473' hidden='true' id='16' story-point-id='8' type-v2='text' w='42815' x='99409' y='17116'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#002060' fontname='Cambria,serif' fontsize='18' underline='true'>Dashboard 2 - Affordability &amp; Economic Impact:</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='18'>Æ </run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Cambria,serif' fontsize='12'>Dashboard of How Inflation Rate, Interest Rate &amp; House Preference influence Housing Affordability across the Years of 2015 to 2025.</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='12'>Æ </run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Cambria,serif' fontsize='12'>This dashboard focuses on how economic factors like Housing price increase across years, income level, inflation, and interest rates affect housing affordability. It connects financial conditions with real estate outcomes.</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='12'>Æ </run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Cambria,serif' fontsize='12'>It helps identify regions where people struggle to afford homes despite economic strength. This makes it useful for understanding affordability gaps.</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='12'>Æ </run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Cambria,serif' fontsize='12' underline='true'>KPIs Used:</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='12'>Æ </run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Cambria,serif' fontsize='12'>Average Inflation Rate across Countries.</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='12'>Æ </run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Cambria,serif' fontsize='12'>Average Interest Rate across Countries.</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='12'>Æ </run>
          </formatted-text>
        </zone>
        <zone flipboard-zone-id='5' forceUpdate='true' h='58921' hidden='true' id='17' story-point-id='9' type-v2='text' w='92323' x='3642' y='28734'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#002060' fontname='Cambria,serif' fontsize='20' underline='true'>Conclusions from this Analysis:</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Cambria,serif' fontsize='16'>• Housing prices show a strong upward trend across most countries.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Cambria,serif' fontsize='16'>• High price growth does not always translate to better affordability.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Cambria,serif' fontsize='16'>• Regions with high PPP face housing affordability challenges.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Cambria,serif' fontsize='16'>• Population growth is a key driver of increasing housing demand and prices.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Cambria,serif' fontsize='16'>• High interest and inflation rates negatively impact affordability.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Cambria,serif' fontsize='16'>• Some emerging markets show rapid growth but higher financial risk.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Cambria,serif' fontsize='16'>• Stable markets offer balanced growth with moderate affordability levels.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Cambria,serif' fontsize='16'>• Declining markets indicate lower growth and potential investment risks.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Cambria,serif' fontsize='16'>The Housing Affordability Report based on this dataset provides valuable insights into global real estate trends, economic influences, and affordability challenges. The analysis helps in understanding how factors like PPP, income, inflation, and interest rates shape housing markets. These insights support data-driven decision-making and help identify investment opportunities, risk areas, and regions facing affordability issues.</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='16'>Æ </run>
          </formatted-text>
        </zone>
        <zone flipboard-zone-id='5' forceUpdate='true' h='57054' hidden='true' id='18' story-point-id='10' type-v2='text' w='92028' x='3937' y='28942'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#002060' fontname='Cambria,serif' fontsize='20' underline='true'>Introduction:</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Calisto MT' fontsize='16'>• This project presents a comprehensive analysis of housing affordability across multiple countries and major cities.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Calisto MT' fontsize='16'>
• Focus on key economic and real estate factors affecting housing markets.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Calisto MT' fontsize='16'>
• Examination of metrics such as housing prices, growth rates, PPP, income levels, and affordability ratios.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Calisto MT' fontsize='16'>
• Analysis of interest rates, inflation, and population growth impacting real estate trends.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Calisto MT' fontsize='16'>
• Segmentation of data by countries, cities, house types, and market conditions.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Calisto MT' fontsize='16'>
• Identification of global housing trends, affordability challenges, and investment opportunities.</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </zone>
        <zone flipboard-zone-id='5' forceUpdate='true' h='21888' hidden='true' id='19' story-point-id='11' type-v2='text' w='89469' x='5217' y='47095'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#c290b4' fontname='Calisto MT' fontsize='48' underline='true'>Housing Affordability Analysis</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </zone>
        <zone flipboard-zone-id='5' forceUpdate='true' h='77593' hidden='true' id='21' story-point-id='12' type-v2='text' w='92126' x='3740' y='19295'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#ff0000' fontname='Calisto MT' fontsize='20' underline='true'>Agenda</run>
            <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Calisto MT' fontsize='16' underline='true'>Introduction:</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Calisto MT'>Introducing the Housing Affordability Analytics report, covering global housing trends and key economic factors influencing affordability across countries and cities.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Calisto MT' fontsize='16' underline='true'>Objective:</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Calisto MT'>To analyze housing prices, affordability, and economic indicators to derive insights and understand their future impact on real estate markets.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Calisto MT' fontsize='16' underline='true'>Dataset Overview:</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Calisto MT'>Quick Overview of the dataset what factors have been taken into consideration, on what basis, etc.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Calisto MT' fontsize='16' underline='true'>Data Gathering &amp; Cleaning:</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Calisto MT'>Data is collected from multiple sources and structured into a unified dataset, followed by cleaning, preprocessing, and feature creation for accurate analysis.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Calisto MT' fontsize='16' underline='true'>Visual Explainations &amp; Dashboard Overview:</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Calisto MT'>Understanding key insights through interactive visuals and dashboards to analyze housing trends, affordability, and market performance.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Calisto MT' fontsize='16' underline='true'>Conclusions:</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Calisto MT'>Summarizes key findings on affordability challenges, market trends, and provides insights for better investment and policy decision-making.</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </zone>
        <zone flipboard-zone-id='5' forceUpdate='true' h='49793' id='22' story-point-id='13' type-v2='text' w='91043' x='4331' y='32365'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#002060' fontname='Cambria,serif' fontsize='20' underline='true'>Data Gathering &amp; Cleaning:</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Montserrat' fontsize='16'>The Major steps in gathering these insights for making this report are:-</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='16'>Æ </run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='18' underline='true'>1.</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Calibri' fontsize='18' underline='true'>Data Scrapping:</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Calibri' fontsize='16'>The data has been acquired from online source in CSV format.</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='16'>Æ </run>
            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Calibri' fontsize='18' underline='true'>2. Data Cleaning:- </run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Calibri' fontsize='16'>After that I cleaned the data in Excel Power Query, check the format and remove null values from it and also check the data type is it in correct form or not.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Calibri' fontsize='18' underline='true'>3. Further Adjustments</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Calibri' fontsize='18'>:</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Calibri' fontsize='16'>Then I load the data in Tableau made further adjustments and started analyzing data by creating Charts in Sheets &amp; Dashboard. And finally Creating a Story Presentation to Present the Work Done.</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </zone>
        <zone flipboard-zone-id='5' forceUpdate='true' h='44502' hidden='true' id='23' story-point-id='14' type-v2='text' w='91831' x='3839' y='36100'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#002060' fontname='Cambria,serif' fontsize='20' underline='true'>Objectives:</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='16'>•</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Calisto MT' fontsize='16'> To analyze the impact of PPP, inflation, interest rates, and population growth on housing affordability.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Calisto MT' fontsize='16'>• To study housing price trends and market performance across different countries and cities.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Calisto MT' fontsize='16'>• To identify affordability challenges and regions with economic pressure in the housing sector.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Calisto MT' fontsize='16'>• To generate meaningful insights that support better investment and real estate decision-making.</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </zone>
        <zone flipboard-zone-id='5' forceUpdate='true' h='46992' hidden='true' id='24' story-point-id='15' type-v2='text' w='90846' x='4724' y='34544'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#002060' fontname='Cambria,serif' fontsize='20' underline='true'>Dataset Overview:</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#002060' fontname='Cambria,serif' fontsize='18' underline='true'>Æ </run>
            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Cambria,serif' fontsize='16'>• This dataset represents </run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Cambria,serif' fontsize='16'>Global Housing Prices and Affordability Analysis</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Cambria,serif' fontsize='16'> across multiple countries and major cities.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Cambria,serif' fontsize='16'>• It combines real estate data with macroeconomic indicators to study how factors like purchasing power, inflation, and interest rates influence housing markets. </run>
            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Cambria,serif' fontsize='16'>• The primary objective of the dataset is to identify relationships between </run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Cambria,serif' fontsize='16'>price growth, economic strength, and affordability</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Cambria,serif' fontsize='16'>. </run>
            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Cambria,serif' fontsize='16'>• It helps in understanding what factors have resulted in the Increase of Housing Prices across the years of 2015 to 2025 around the Globe.</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </zone>
      </zones>
      <simple-id uuid='{E5C72736-C33E-4C10-9B05-03934E06907C}' />
    </dashboard>
  </dashboards>
